## Restore mobile SPARQL results and keyboard focus

Context: Browser verification found that the stacked mobile SPARQL workspace
collapsed successful query results to zero height and did not reliably expose
visible keyboard focus on its language tabs and controls.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/query/css/query-sparql.css
   Restore SPARQL-only natural mobile flow, reserve a scrollable result surface, and add SPARQL-scoped token-based focus-visible indicators.
2. tests/units/front/test_sparql_playground_contract.py
   Add parsed CSS contracts for the mobile layout, result scroll ownership, and explicit keyboard focus styles.

