## Isolate the mobile SPARQL cascade

Context: Follow-up review found that the mobile natural-flow reset also
matched the active GraphQL pane and that the CSS contract did not model the
later shared stylesheet's competing result minimum.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/query/css/query-sparql.css
   Limit responsive natural-flow resets to the active SPARQL pane while preserving the stacked playground and result minimum.
2. tests/units/front/test_sparql_playground_contract.py
   Add GraphQL-exclusion assertions and a focused specificity-aware cascade helper using the template's real stylesheet order.

